Audio Duration: 4m 20.6s (260.62s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 14:25:55 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 0.99)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,140] | Elapsed:  12.68s | Words: 9  | Text: 你说咱背景理想出来图什么
Segment #2   [00:00:02,140 --> 00:00:04,240] | Elapsed:  12.68s | Words: 10 | Text: 那我们就在农村砸个煎饼
Segment #3   [00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:06,540] | Elapsed:  12.68s | Words: 12 | Text: 真想吹两万块钱的话好几个月
Segment #4   [00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:09,240] | Elapsed:  12.68s | Words: 11 | Text: 百来万的房子十几万的车
Segment #5   [00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:10,660] | Elapsed:  12.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 没任何生活压力
Segment #6   [00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:13,340] | Elapsed:  12.68s | Words: 8  | Text: 人间烟火灯火通明
Segment #7   [00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:14,640] | Elapsed:  12.68s | Words: 5  | Text: 陪陪老婆孩子
Segment #8   [00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,800] | Elapsed:  12.68s | Words: 8  | Text: 无所求就无所拘业
Segment #9   [00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,900] | Elapsed:  12.68s | Words: 10 | Text: 不是每一个人都想出人徒弟
Segment #10  [00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:20,940] | Elapsed:  12.68s | Words: 7  | Text: 对于大部分的人来说
Segment #11  [00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:22,300] | Elapsed:  12.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 有个稳定的工作
Segment #12  [00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:24,060] | Elapsed:  12.68s | Words: 7  | Text: 有个幸福的家庭
Segment #13  [00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:25,320] | Elapsed:  12.68s | Words: 3  | Text: 孩子健康
Segment #14  [00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:27,340] | Elapsed:  12.68s | Words: 7  | Text: 有个爱你的好老婆
Segment #15  [00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:28,580] | Elapsed:  12.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 这不就够了吗
Segment #16  [00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:30,440] | Elapsed:  27.34s | Words: 5  | Text: 但是咱说实话
Segment #17  [00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:31,560] | Elapsed:  27.35s | Words: 5  | Text: 你爱的那个人
Segment #18  [00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,300] | Elapsed:  27.35s | Words: 9  | Text: 他愿意和你过这样的生活
Segment #19  [00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:35,360] | Elapsed:  27.35s | Words: 6  | Text: 或者说有人愿意吗
Segment #20  [00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:37,040] | Elapsed:  27.35s | Words: 8  | Text: 这不问题就摆在这吗
Segment #21  [00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:38,060] | Elapsed:  27.35s | Words: 3  | Text: 你的父母
Segment #22  [00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:40,080] | Elapsed:  27.35s | Words: 11 | Text: 会拿隔壁的孩子和你做比较
Segment #23  [00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:41,480] | Elapsed:  27.35s | Words: 4  | Text: 咱不这样的
Segment #24  [00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:42,580] | Elapsed:  27.35s | Words: 4  | Text: 见过更好的
Segment #25  [00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:44,420] | Elapsed:  27.35s | Words: 10 | Text: 谁会选择更差劲的人生的
Segment #26  [00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:45,640] | Elapsed:  27.35s | Words: 4  | Text: 所以说没招
Segment #27  [00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:47,260] | Elapsed:  27.35s | Words: 8  | Text: 哪里机会大往哪去
Segment #28  [00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:49,980] | Elapsed:  27.35s | Words: 8  | Text: 往上一大堆人说了
Segment #29  [00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:52,060] | Elapsed:  27.35s | Words: 7  | Text: 幸福不是有权有势
Segment #30  [00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:53,260] | Elapsed:  27.35s | Words: 5  | Text: 不是有车有缝
Segment #31  [00:00:53,900 --> 00:00:55,660] | Elapsed:  27.35s | Words: 7  | Text: 实则是无忧无虑
Segment #32  [00:00:56,220 --> 00:00:57,180] | Elapsed:  27.35s | Words: 4  | Text: 无病无灾
Segment #33  [00:00:57,180 --> 00:00:58,660] | Elapsed:  42.74s | Words: 7  | Text: 有都是给别人看的
Segment #34  [00:00:58,660 --> 00:00:59,940] | Elapsed:  42.74s | Words: 5  | Text: 无才是自己的
Segment #35  [00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:01,220] | Elapsed:  42.74s | Words: 6  | Text: 你在话有毛病吗
Segment #36  [00:01:01,220 --> 00:01:01,820] | Elapsed:  42.74s | Words: 3  | Text: 没毛病
Segment #37  [00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:03,700] | Elapsed:  42.74s | Words: 5  | Text: 但是我不敢保障
Segment #38  [00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:05,200] | Elapsed:  42.74s | Words: 7  | Text: 咱的父母老婆孩子
Segment #39  [00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:06,200] | Elapsed:  42.74s | Words: 3  | Text: 每一个人
Segment #40  [00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:07,640] | Elapsed:  42.74s | Words: 9  | Text: 他们都能达到这种层次
Segment #41  [00:01:07,640 --> 00:01:09,760] | Elapsed:  42.74s | Words: 10 | Text: 他们不可能有这么冲动的思维
Segment #42  [00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:12,860] | Elapsed:  42.74s | Words: 10 | Text: 但是他们会因为我的无能而伤心
Segment #43  [00:01:13,380 --> 00:01:15,000] | Elapsed:  42.74s | Words: 9  | Text: 甚至有个病有个灾的
Segment #44  [00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,740] | Elapsed:  42.74s | Words: 6  | Text: 还会去保守症
Segment #45  [00:01:18,180 --> 00:01:19,780] | Elapsed:  42.75s | Words: 7  | Text: 他们也会羡慕别人
Segment #46  [00:01:19,780 --> 00:01:20,680] | Elapsed:  42.75s | Words: 4  | Text: 聊到这儿
Segment #47  [00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:22,480] | Elapsed:  42.75s | Words: 7  | Text: 你还觉得自己没有责任
Segment #48  [00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:24,400] | Elapsed:  42.75s | Words: 10 | Text: 你还会用安逸在两个字
Segment #49  [00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:26,480] | Elapsed:  42.75s | Words: 12 | Text: 当做借口来逃避到自己的无能
Segment #50  [00:01:27,100 --> 00:01:29,340] | Elapsed:  58.27s | Words: 11 | Text: 你说他穷极一生追求的幸福
Segment #51  [00:01:29,340 --> 00:01:31,240] | Elapsed:  58.27s | Words: 11 | Text: 他不是精神层面的这些东西
Segment #52  [00:01:31,240 --> 00:01:32,760] | Elapsed:  58.27s | Words: 6  | Text: 你我都不是和尚
Segment #53  [00:01:32,760 --> 00:01:34,300] | Elapsed:  58.27s | Words: 7  | Text: 不是说没有气情流域
Segment #54  [00:01:34,300 --> 00:01:36,160] | Elapsed:  58.27s | Words: 6  | Text: 你就什么都误明不了
Segment #55  [00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:37,700] | Elapsed:  58.27s | Words: 9  | Text: 你现实吃不上四个菜
Segment #56  [00:01:37,700 --> 00:01:39,020] | Elapsed:  58.27s | Words: 7  | Text: 你说这样他不悲哀吗
Segment #57  [00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:40,500] | Elapsed:  58.27s | Words: 4  | Text: 不自卑吗
Segment #58  [00:01:41,160 --> 00:01:43,100] | Elapsed:  58.27s | Words: 10 | Text: 他到了一定的年纪你会发现
Segment #59  [00:01:43,100 --> 00:01:45,180] | Elapsed:  58.27s | Words: 7  | Text: 需要你的人越来越多
Segment #60  [00:01:45,180 --> 00:01:46,260] | Elapsed:  58.27s | Words: 3  | Text: 你不能倒
Segment #61  [00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:48,500] | Elapsed:  58.27s | Words: 10 | Text: 但是你能靠得住的没几个
Segment #62  [00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:50,900] | Elapsed:  58.27s | Words: 6  | Text: 父母 老婆 孩子 工作
Segment #63  [00:01:50,900 --> 00:01:51,820] | Elapsed:  58.27s | Words: 5  | Text: 各种的压力
Segment #64  [00:01:51,820 --> 00:01:53,340] | Elapsed:  58.27s | Words: 7  | Text: 你没法不去分导
Segment #65  [00:01:53,340 --> 00:01:55,440] | Elapsed:  58.28s | Words: 10 | Text: 你一听全家人都在饿死
Segment #66  [00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:58,380] | Elapsed:  74.66s | Words: 8  | Text: 那趁着年轻拼命工作
Segment #67  [00:01:58,380 --> 00:01:59,460] | Elapsed:  74.66s | Words: 3  | Text: 有毛病
Segment #68  [00:01:59,460 --> 00:02:01,980] | Elapsed:  74.66s | Words: 14 | Text: 那奋斗不也是成就自己人生的过程吗
Segment #69  [00:02:01,980 --> 00:02:02,620] | Elapsed:  74.66s | Words: 4  | Text: 能有多惨
Segment #70  [00:02:02,620 --> 00:02:04,620] | Elapsed:  74.66s | Words: 8  | Text: 吃不上了 饿肚子了
Segment #71  [00:02:04,620 --> 00:02:05,840] | Elapsed:  74.66s | Words: 4  | Text: 不至于吧
Segment #72  [00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:07,760] | Elapsed:  74.66s | Words: 6  | Text: 胳膊腿都在吧
Segment #73  [00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:09,100] | Elapsed:  74.66s | Words: 7  | Text: 那在这个最有激情
Segment #74  [00:02:09,100 --> 00:02:10,560] | Elapsed:  74.66s | Words: 9  | Text: 最有旺盛的年龄段里
Segment #75  [00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,620] | Elapsed:  74.66s | Words: 4  | Text: 胆子大一点
Segment #76  [00:02:11,620 --> 00:02:12,920] | Elapsed:  74.66s | Words: 4  | Text: 拼一拼 怎么了
Segment #77  [00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:14,220] | Elapsed:  74.66s | Words: 3  | Text: 丢人了
Segment #78  [00:02:14,220 --> 00:02:15,860] | Elapsed:  74.66s | Words: 6  | Text: 别从天上飞了
Segment #79  [00:02:15,860 --> 00:02:16,900] | Elapsed:  74.66s | Words: 6  | Text: 你下地瞅一瞅
Segment #80  [00:02:16,900 --> 00:02:18,680] | Elapsed:  74.66s | Words: 7  | Text: 看一看民间生活吧
Segment #81  [00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:19,780] | Elapsed:  74.66s | Words: 3  | Text: 我以前也是
Segment #82  [00:02:19,780 --> 00:02:21,960] | Elapsed:  74.66s | Words: 12 | Text: 我以前我身上二三十都拿不出来
Segment #83  [00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:24,060] | Elapsed:  74.66s | Words: 9  | Text: 我都觉得几百W是小钱
Segment #84  [00:02:24,060 --> 00:02:25,880] | Elapsed:  89.96s | Words: 7  | Text: 这不就是心比天高
Segment #85  [00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:26,860] | Elapsed:  89.96s | Words: 5  | Text: 命比之宝吗
Segment #86  [00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:28,980] | Elapsed:  89.96s | Words: 7  | Text: 养育之人咱得抱
Segment #87  [00:02:28,980 --> 00:02:30,720] | Elapsed:  89.96s | Words: 7  | Text: 富育之责咱得尽
Segment #88  [00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:32,740] | Elapsed:  89.96s | Words: 8  | Text: 人情事故咱得还了
Segment #89  [00:02:32,740 --> 00:02:35,100] | Elapsed:  89.96s | Words: 9  | Text: 这不才甘愿人辱前行
Segment #90  [00:02:35,100 --> 00:02:36,200] | Elapsed:  89.96s | Words: 5  | Text: 甘愿低头吗
Segment #91  [00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:36,980] | Elapsed:  89.96s | Words: 1  | Text: 为什么
Segment #92  [00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:39,840] | Elapsed:  89.96s | Words: 11 | Text: 大部分瞎踏在别人五眼下的人
Segment #93  [00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:40,980] | Elapsed:  89.96s | Words: 4  | Text: 咱都非常清楚
Segment #94  [00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:42,260] | Elapsed:  89.96s | Words: 3  | Text: 没得选
Segment #95  [00:02:42,260 --> 00:02:43,180] | Elapsed:  89.96s | Words: 3  | Text: 没有选择
Segment #96  [00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:44,380] | Elapsed:  89.96s | Words: 2  | Text: 有人说
Segment #97  [00:02:44,380 --> 00:02:45,340] | Elapsed:  89.96s | Words: 4  | Text: 你这没自由
Segment #98  [00:02:45,900 --> 00:02:47,300] | Elapsed:  89.96s | Words: 8  | Text: 我这想干什么就干什么
Segment #99  [00:02:47,300 --> 00:02:47,940] | Elapsed:  89.96s | Words: 3  | Text: 我多自由
Segment #100 [00:02:48,460 --> 00:02:49,960] | Elapsed:  89.96s | Words: 5  | Text: 兄弟 你错了
Segment #101 [00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:51,460] | Elapsed:  89.96s | Words: 7  | Text: 自由是你不想干什么
Segment #102 [00:02:51,460 --> 00:02:52,560] | Elapsed:  89.96s | Words: 4  | Text: 就可以不干什么
Segment #103 [00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:54,120] | Elapsed: 105.04s | Words: 2  | Text: 有人说
Segment #104 [00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,220] | Elapsed: 105.04s | Words: 7  | Text: 在杯子喂这点钱
Segment #105 [00:02:55,220 --> 00:02:56,180] | Elapsed: 105.04s | Words: 3  | Text: 太卑微
Segment #106 [00:02:56,740 --> 00:02:58,160] | Elapsed: 105.04s | Words: 6  | Text: 我给大家决定了
Segment #107 [00:02:58,160 --> 00:02:59,460] | Elapsed: 105.04s | Words: 5  | Text: 现在大伙见面
Segment #108 [00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:00,940] | Elapsed: 105.04s | Words: 4  | Text: 先发个烟
Segment #109 [00:03:01,340 --> 00:03:02,140] | Elapsed: 105.05s | Words: 2  | Text: 问你
Segment #110 [00:03:02,140 --> 00:03:03,480] | Elapsed: 105.05s | Words: 6  | Text: 您最近做什么生意
Segment #111 [00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:04,720] | Elapsed: 105.05s | Words: 6  | Text: 您现在在哪高就
Segment #112 [00:03:05,180 --> 00:03:07,280] | Elapsed: 105.05s | Words: 8  | Text: 你以为在关心你了
Segment #113 [00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:08,860] | Elapsed: 105.05s | Words: 5  | Text: 他们这是在遍于
Segment #114 [00:03:08,860 --> 00:03:10,360] | Elapsed: 105.05s | Words: 7  | Text: 计算你的尊重程度
Segment #115 [00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:12,420] | Elapsed: 105.05s | Words: 10 | Text: 或者说可以利用资源的多数
Segment #116 [00:03:12,420 --> 00:03:13,440] | Elapsed: 105.05s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #117 [00:03:13,440 --> 00:03:15,340] | Elapsed: 105.05s | Words: 7  | Text: 借助到哪都一样
Segment #118 [00:03:15,340 --> 00:03:17,920] | Elapsed: 105.05s | Words: 12 | Text: 互相尊重的前提是实力强大
Segment #119 [00:03:17,920 --> 00:03:19,760] | Elapsed: 105.05s | Words: 8  | Text: 只有你自己实力强大了
Segment #120 [00:03:19,760 --> 00:03:21,560] | Elapsed: 105.05s | Words: 11 | Text: 你才能感受到这个世界的美好
